    <detaileddescription>
<para>Base class for graph edge traversals.</para><para><ref refid="structEdge" kindref="compound">Edge</ref> traversals increment their current position stopping only when an edge is entered. They have dereference (&quot;*&quot;) and arrow (&quot;-&gt;&quot;) operators and a <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1Algorithm_1_1GraphEdgeTraversal_1a511c08698e8727dc14d9e63831fd3c52" kindref="member">next</ref> method that return edge nodes from the graph. </para>    </detaileddescription>
